            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              57.94446563720703,
              79.0199966430664,
              66.94446563720703
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "In a single-pilot operation, pilots often gather, organize, and manage available resources before flight to make it easier to ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              68.0127182006836,
              560.506103515625,
              78.0127182006836
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "assess and manage risks and make informed aeronautical decisions. The comprehensive planning and preparation activities ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              79.0127182006836,
              560.5133056640625,
              89.0127182006836
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "described earlier in chapters 3, 4, and 5 facilitate SRM. If the pilot prepares for scenarios that may occur during a flight, such ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              90.0127182006836,
              560.4671630859375,
              100.0127182006836
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "as a diversion or precautionary landing, it becomes easier to consider and perform that option with the needed information ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              101.0127182006836,
              560.5130004882812,
              111.0127182006836
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "at hand. For example, while en route to an airport the aircraft alternator fails. After completing the appropriate checklist, the ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              112.0127182006836,
              560.5331420898438,
              122.0127182006836
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "alternator remains off line, and the battery will only provide electricity for a short time. The pilot decides to divert to the nearest ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              123.0127182006836,
              560.531982421875,
              133.01272583007812
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "suitable airport. Does the pilot know the destinations along the route of flight that qualify? Did the pilot organize personal and ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              134.01272583007812,
              560.5291137695312,
              144.01272583007812
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "flight deck resources to access information such as communication frequencies and navigation aids for the available airports? ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              145.01272583007812,
              560.5172119140625,
              155.01272583007812
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "By considering and organizing information before flight, the single pilot may perform such tasks with crew-like efficiency.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              156.01272583007812,
              545.6260986328125,
              166.01272583007812
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chapter Summary",
            "font_name": "Arial-BoldMT",
            "font_size": 11.0,
            "color": "#AA1E22",
            "is_bold": true,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              184.62185668945312,
              148.7429962158203,
              195.62185668945312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "20844",
            "font_name": "Arial-ItalicMT",
            "font_size": 9.0,
            "color": "#FFFFFF",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": true,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              196.74452209472656,
              79.0199966430664,
              205.74452209472656
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aeronautical decision-making occurs during all aspects of flight and begins during flight planning. When in flight, however, ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              206.81277465820312,
              560.5030517578125,
              216.81277465820312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "pilots learn to deal with any threat using appropriate analytical thinking. The analytical process prevails unless time pressure ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              217.81277465820312,
              560.5021362304688,
              227.81277465820312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and lack of an existing procedure calls for naturalistic decision-making. The 3P model illustrates a closed-loop process that ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              228.81277465820312,
              560.5097045898438,
              238.81277465820312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "pilots use to reinforce appropriate decision-making. Several models address ADM, and pilots should study and use the model ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              239.81277465820312,
              560.5052490234375,
              249.81277465820312
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "they find effective.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.0,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              54.0,
              250.81277465820312,
              129.62301635742188,
              260.8127746582031
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
